## 3. Dual-Backend Architecture & Migration Status
## 3. Dual-Backend Architecture & Feature Comparison

The project currently contains two backend implementations:

1. **`backend/` (Legacy / Feature-Complete):**
   - Built with Java 17, Spring Boot 3.1.5, Spring Data JPA, Hibernate, and Spring Security.
   - Deployed via Docker / Docker Compose.
   - Includes full Cloud Storage (Backblaze B2 via AWS S3 SDK), SMTP email notifications, all Admin CRUD endpoints, and live queue polling.

2. **`express-backend/` (Modern / In-Progress Vercel Migration):**
   - Built with TypeScript, Express.js 5, and Prisma ORM targeting serverless hosting on Vercel.
   - Uses serverless PostgreSQL (e.g., Neon).
   - Core customer-facing flows (Auth, Menu, Order placement, Coupon application, Razorpay webhook signature validation) have been ported.

### Current Migration Progress & Gaps to Note:

| Feature / Module | Spring Boot (`backend/`) | Express (`express-backend/`) | Status / Action Needed |
| Feature / Module | Spring Boot (`backend/`) | Express.js (`express-backend/`) | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| User Register & Login | `AuthController.java` | `controllers/authController.ts` | Complete |
| Make Admin Backdoor | `/api/auth/make-admin` | `/api/auth/make-admin` | Complete |
| Menu Query | `MenuController.java` | `controllers/menuController.ts` | Complete |
| Order Creation & Razorpay Order | `OrderService.java` | `services/orderService.ts` | Complete |
| Coupon Engine | `OrderService.applyCoupon` | `services/orderService.ts` | Complete |
| Razorpay Webhook | `PaymentService.java` | `services/paymentService.ts` | Complete (raw body parsing supported) |
| User Order History | `OrderHistoryController.java` | `controllers/orderController.ts` | Complete (`/api/orders/user/:userId`) |
| Admin: Get Active Orders | `AdminController.java` | `controllers/adminController.ts` | Complete |
| Admin: Update Order Status | `AdminController.java` | `controllers/adminController.ts` | Complete |
| Admin: Menu Item CRUD | `AdminController.java` | Missing | Needs porting to Express |
| Admin: Addon CRUD | `AdminController.java` | Missing | Needs porting to Express |
| Admin: Coupon Creation | `AdminController.java` | Missing | Needs porting to Express |
| Admin: Presigned S3 Upload URL | `StorageService.java` | Missing | Needs `@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner` port |
| Asynchronous Email Service | `EmailService.java` | Missing | Needs Nodemailer / Resend integration |
| Routing Path in `api/index.ts` | N/A | Bug in import path | `api/index.ts` imports `./routes/*` but routes are in `../src/routes/*` |
| NPM Scripts in `express-backend` | N/A | Missing dev runner | Needs `"dev": "tsx watch api/index.ts"` in `package.json` |
| Runtime / Framework | Java 17, Spring Boot 3.1.5 | Node.js, Express 5, TypeScript | Express is deployed on Vercel Edge/Serverless |
| ORM / Database | Hibernate / JPA + PostgreSQL | Prisma ORM 7 + PostgreSQL | Neon PostgreSQL recommended for Vercel |
| Caching | Redis (Docker) | Upstash Redis (`ioredis`) | In-memory fallback if Redis unavailable |
| Rate Limiting | Custom / Spring Security | Custom sliding window middleware | Prevents brute force on Auth & Checkout |
| Menu Caching | Cache-aside | Upstash cached with admin invalidation | Cache keys: `menuCache::allMenuItems`, `menuCache::carouselOptions` |
| S3 Storage | `software.amazon.awssdk.s3` | `@aws-sdk/client-s3` + presigner | Backblaze B2 S3-compatible endpoints |
| DB Backup Cron | Manual | `/api/backup/database` | Triggered via Vercel Cron to B2 bucket |
| Dynamic Carousel | Static assets | Fully dynamic via `CarouselImage` table | Admin can upload, toggle, reorder, delete |
| Frontend API URL | Hardcoded `http://localhost:8080` | Dynamic `import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL` | Defaults to `http://localhost:8080` if unset |

