## 6. API Routing & Contracts

Base URL: `http://localhost:8080` (Spring Boot) or `http://localhost:3000` (Express)
Base URL: `http://localhost:8080` (Spring Boot), `http://localhost:3000` (Express), or `VITE_API_URL` in production.

### 6.1 Authentication (`/api/auth`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Request Body / Params | Response |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | Public | `{ name, email, phone, password }` | `{ token, userId, name, role }` |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | Public | `{ email, password }` | `{ token, userId, name, role }` |
| `GET` | `/api/auth/make-admin` | Public | Query: `?email=user@example.com` | Success/Failure string message |
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/auth/register` | Public (Rate Limited) | Create user account; returns JWT & role |
| `POST` | `/api/auth/login` | Public (Rate Limited) | Authenticate credentials; returns JWT & role |
| `GET` | `/api/auth/make-admin` | Public | Upgrades account to `ADMIN` by email |

