| `POST` | `/api/orders/applycoupon` | Auth | `{ couponCode: "..." }` | `{ valid, message, discountType, discountValue, minOrderValue }` |
| `GET` | `/api/orders/user/:userId` | Auth (Self) | Path param: `userId` | `Order[]` with items and addons |
