### 6.4 Payment (`/api/payment`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Headers / Body | Response |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/payment/webhook` | Public (Signature Verified) | Header: `x-razorpay-signature`<br>Body: Raw JSON payload | HTTP 200 (acknowledged) or 400 |
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/api/payment/webhook` | Raw Body | Validates HMAC-SHA256 signature and updates order status |

### 6.5 Admin (`/api/admin`) — Requires `ADMIN` Role
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description / Params | Response |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders` | Admin | All orders descending by ID | `Order[]` |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders/active` | Admin | Orders in CONFIRMED, PREPARING, OUT_FOR_DELIVERY | `Order[]` |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/orders/:id/status`| Admin | Query: `?status=...` | Updated `Order` entity |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/upload-url` | Admin | Query: `?filename=...&contentType=...` | `{ uploadUrl, finalUrl }` |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/menu` | Admin | Body: `MenuItem` entity | Created `MenuItem` |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/menu/:id` | Admin | Body: Updated `MenuItem` entity | Updated `MenuItem` |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/addons` | Admin | None | `Addon[]` |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/addons` | Admin | Body: `Addon` entity | Created `Addon` |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/addons/:id` | Admin | Body: Updated `Addon` entity | Updated `Addon` |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/coupons` | Admin | Body: `Coupon` entity | Created `Coupon` |
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders` | Fetch all historical orders |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/orders/active` | Fetch active kitchen orders |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/orders/:id/status` | Update order status |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/upload-url` | Generate Backblaze B2 S3 presigned upload URL |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/menu` | Add menu item (purges menu cache) |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/menu/:id` | Update menu item (purges menu cache) |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/menu/:id` | Delete menu item (purges menu cache) |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/addons` | List all available addons |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/addons` | Create new addon |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/addons/:id` | Update addon |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/addons/:id` | Delete addon |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/coupons` | Create coupon |
| `GET` | `/api/admin/carousel` | List all carousel banner images |
| `POST` | `/api/admin/carousel` | Add new carousel banner (purges carousel cache) |
| `PUT` | `/api/admin/carousel/:id` | Toggle active status or order of carousel banner |
| `DELETE` | `/api/admin/carousel/:id` | Delete carousel banner |

### 6.6 Backup (`/api/backup`)
| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GET` | `/api/backup/database` | CRON_SECRET | Exports JSON dump of database tables to S3 bucket |

