## 7. Frontend Architecture (Vue 3 SPA)

- **Framework:** Vue 3 (Composition API `<script setup>`) with Vite and Pinia.
- **Entry Point:** `frontend/src/main.js` instantiates app, registers router and Pinia.
- **Routing & Guards (`frontend/src/router/index.js`):**
  - Route `/`: `HomeView.vue`
  - Route `/menu`: `MenuView.vue`
  - Route `/checkout`: `CheckoutView.vue`
  - Route `/history`: `HistoryView.vue` (`meta: { requiresAuth: true }`)
  - Route `/admin`: `AdminView.vue` (`meta: { requiresAdmin: true }`)
  - Global `beforeEach` navigation guard checks `authStore.isAuthenticated` and `authStore.isAdmin`.
- **State Management:**
  - `stores/auth.js`: Manages JWT `token` and `user` object in reactive state and `localStorage`. Provides `getAuthHeaders()` returning `{ 'Authorization': 'Bearer <token>' }`.
  - `stores/cart.js`: Manages cart items, handles addon selection hashing (`cartItemId = ${menuItem.id}-${addonIdsString}`), local estimation of subtotals, and `getBackendPayload()` formatter.
- **Styling (`frontend/src/style.css`):**
  - Brand color: `#e84a20` (warm orange-red), background `#f9f9f9`, dark `#1a1a1a`.
  - Veg indicator (green dot inside square) and non-veg indicator (red dot).
  - Responsive flex/grid design, clean modal dialogs, status badges.
  - `stores/auth.js`: Token and user object in reactive state and `localStorage`. Supplies `getAuthHeaders()`.
  - `stores/cart.js`: Cart items, addon selection hashing, local subtotal computation, and payload formatting.
- **Dynamic API Target:**
  - Uses `const API_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:8080'` across all views and components.
- **Component Views:**
  - `HomeView.vue`: Features dynamic banner carousel with smooth indicators and quick order CTA.
  - `MenuView.vue`: Category pills, search bar, item cards with veg/non-veg dots, addon tags.
  - `CheckoutView.vue`: Cart review, coupon field, address inputs, Razorpay checkout modal trigger.
  - `HistoryView.vue`: List of previous orders with real-time status badges.
  - `AdminView.vue`: Tabbed command center covering Live Queue, History, Menu CRUD, Addon CRUD, Coupons, and Carousel management.

